<p><em>Down in Mammoth Cave, is where his body laid,<br />
The walls caved in, life could not be saved,<br />
No man-made machine could see the things he'd seen,<br />
Mr. Collins, you did not die in vain!</em><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cTzQ2DtubMw">Black Stone Cherry - Ghost of Floyd Collins</a></p>
<p>Big heckin' scip here. One of the longer things I've ever written. Original draft was last Decemberish and I got a wild hair to go back over it this last week. It might still be a bit unwieldy, but this also feels like the best I can get it. Hope you all like it.</p>
<p>Thanks to Hippo (a year ago!) and BlueJones for giving me crit on the IRC. Hippo also gave me a much better idea for how to handle Floyd. Thanks also to my real-life buddies Carl and Rasheab for proofreading and feedback too.</p>
<p>The image of Sand Cave was borrowed from:</p>
<p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sand_Cave.jpg">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sand_Cave.jpg</a><br />
<strong>Creator</strong>: Nicholas Frost</p>
<p>(The picture of Floyd has been reprinted in just about every book and article on the subject and I can't track down the original photographer. As near as I can tell it's public domain since it's 90+ years old at this point. I'll remove it if there's any evidence to the contrary.)</p>

